  "releaseNotes": "Update to ffmpeg 8.1.2 \"Hoarse\".\n\t\t\tFormatContext was split into DemuxerContext and MuxerContext.\n\t\t\tMediaSource no longer thread-safe. It doesn't make sense to make it thread-safe as most of the time it will only be called from one thread.\n\t\t\tUpdate dependencies.",
